==Broadcasting==

The cup final resulted in record viewing figures with over half the viewing public in the United Kingdom, alongside 193 countries, tuning in.<ref name=recViewFigs>{{cite web| last = Ewing| first = Harry| title = Newcastle win fuels increased engagement with Carabao Cup| website = insiderworldfootball.com| date = 19 March 2025| url = 
https://www.insideworldfootball.com/2025/03/19/newcastle-win-fuels-increased-engagement-carabao-cup/ | access-date = 20 March 2025
}}</ref> The match was televised live in the United Kingdom via pay-TV broadcaster [[Sky UK|Sky]], who showed the game on their Sky Showcase, Sky Sports Main Event and Sky Sports Football channels. During the game, the Sky Sports Football channel was simulcast on free-to-air channel [[ITV1]] ([[STV (TV channel)|STV]] in Scotland).<ref name="RadioTimes">{{cite web |first=Michael |last=Potts |date=15 March 2025 |title=What channel is Liverpool v Newcastle Carabao Cup final on? TV coverage, live stream and kick-off time |url=https://www.radiotimes.com/tv/sport/football/liverpool-newcastle-carabao-cup-2024-25-preview/ |website=Radio Times |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250316165325/https://www.radiotimes.com/tv/sport/football/liverpool-newcastle-carabao-cup-2024-25-preview/ |archive-date=16 March 2025 |access-date=16 March 2025}}</ref><ref name="Standard">{{cite web |first1=George |last1=Flood |first2=Dom |last2=Smith |date=16 March 2025 |title=Liverpool vs Newcastle LIVE: Carabao Cup final match stream, latest score and goal updates today |url=https://www.standard.co.uk/sport/football/liverpool-fc-vs-newcastle-live-stream-latest-score-updates-result-carabao-cup-final-2025-b1216969.html?page=9 |website=London Standard |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250318012831/https://www.standard.co.uk/sport/football/liverpool-fc-vs-newcastle-live-stream-latest-score-updates-result-carabao-cup-final-2025-b1216969.html?page=9 |archive-date=18 March 2025 |access-date=18 March 2025}}</ref> The final was available for streaming on [[Sky Go]] and [[Now (streaming service)|Now]], with Sky's coverage also streamed live on [[ITVX]] and [[STV Player]].<ref name="RadioTimes" /><ref name="Standard" /> Radio commentary was provided by [[BBC Radio 5 Live]] and [[Talksport]].<ref name="Radio 5 Live">{{cite web |title=Liverpool v Newcastle United: EFL Cup Football 2024-25 |url=https://www.bbc.co.uk/programmes/m002928b |website=BBC |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250316162801/https://www.bbc.co.uk/programmes/m002928b |archive-date=16 March 2025 |access-date=17 March 2025}}</ref><ref name="Talksport">{{cite web |first=Joe |last=Brophy |date=16 March 2025 |title=How to watch Carabao Cup final for FREE as Liverpool take on Newcastle at Wembley |url=https://talksport.com/football/2992168/carabao-cup-final-free-live-stream-tv-channel-how-to-watch-liverpool-newcastle/ |website=Talksport |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250314100813/https://talksport.com/football/2992168/carabao-cup-final-free-live-stream-tv-channel-how-to-watch-liverpool-newcastle/ |archive-date=14 March 2025 |access-date=16 March 2025}}</ref>

